# "When this artifact enters, exile target creature an opponent controls with mana value 3 or less until this artifact leaves
# the battlefield" (CR 115.1, 202.3, 610.3). Bot2's Brazen Borrower is mana value 3, exactly the limit, so it can be targeted (Bot2's Ornithopter is a second legal target, so the choice is asked);
# Bot2's Mox Sapphire (an artifact that is no creature) and Bot1's own Ornithopter (a creature Bot1 controls) are refused.
# Bot1 then destroys the Casket with Disenchant and the Borrower comes back.

